⍝ 10 · Sales report from a CSV file (reads sales.csv next to this script)
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/10-csv-report.apls

here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
t←⎕CSV(here,'sales.csv')'' 4 1           ⍝ 4: numbers as numbers; 1: header row
(data header)←t
⎕←'columns: ',⍕header
⎕←'rows: ',⍕≢data

(region product qty price)←↓⍉data
amount←qty×price

⎕←'total revenue: ',⍕+/amount
⎕←'revenue by region (⌸):'
r←region{⍺,(≢⍵),+/⍵}⌸amount
r←r[⍒r[;3];]                             ⍝ biggest first
⎕←↑{(8↑⊃⍵),(¯4↑⍕2⊃⍵),' orders ',(¯10↑⍕3⊃⍵)}¨↓r

p←product{⍺,+/⍵}⌸qty
⎕←'best-selling product: ',⊃p[⊃⍒p[;2];]
